# sqlx checksums every applied migration by hashing the exact bytes of the SQL
# embedded via include_str! (src-tauri/src/lib.rs). If a checkout flips these
# files to CRLF, the hashes no longer match what is recorded in
# _sqlx_migrations, Migrator::run aborts with a version mismatch, and every
# later migration silently never applies. Pin them to LF on every platform.
*.sql text eol=lf
